        │        ┃        │one
-  1    │alpha   ┃        │
+      1│P1_alpha┃        │
   2   2│bravo   ┃        │
   3   3│charlie ┃        │
   4   4│mark one┃   8   8│mark one
   5   5│mark two┃   9   9│mark two
   6   6│target  ┃- 10    │target
